  "user_set": "OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS=8 at -t 1 leaves 8 live threads (7 library workers and the caller) during a 2 s spin after a product, measured with ps -L; the seed leaves a user value alone and openblas_set_num_threads(1) does not join the constructor pool. The GEMM still runs one thread per call, so those workers are idle. The single-pool promise is conditional on the variable being unset; the unset run has 1 live thread at -t 1."
